        SUAUBUCACUDUSEUEUF $.

      $( Value of the canonical denominator function.  (Contributed by Stefan
         O'Rear, 13-Sep-2014.) $)
      qdenval $p |- ( A e. QQ -> ( denom ` A ) = ( 2nd ` ( iota_ x e. ( ZZ X.
          NN ) ( ( ( 1st ` x ) gcd ( 2nd ` x ) ) = 1 /\ A = ( ( 1st ` x ) / (
