       If ` k ` is ` 0 , 1 , 2 ` , we show ` k e. S ` directly; otherwise if
       ` k ` is composite, ` k ` is the product of two numbers less than it
       (and hence in ` S ` by assumption), so by ~ mul4sq ` k e. S ` .
