       increment values ` a , d ` such that all the numbers
       ` a , a + d , ... , a + ( k - 1 ) d ` lie in the preimage of ` { c } ` ,
       i.e. they are all in ` 1 ... N ` and ` f ` evaluated at each one yields
       ` c ` ).  (Contributed by Mario Carneiro, 13-Sep-2014.) $)
