    $( Lemma for ~ 2503prm .  Calculate a power mod.  We calculate
       ` 2 ^ 1 9 = 2 ^ 1 8 x. 2 == 1 8 3 2 x. 2 = N + 1 1 6 1 ` ,
       ` 2 ^ 3 8 = ( 2 ^ 1 9 ) ^ 2 == 1 1 6 1 ^ 2 = 5 3 8 N + 1 3 0 7 ` ,
       ` 2 ^ 3 9 = 2 ^ 3 8 x. 2 == 1 3 0 7 x. 2 = N + 1 1 1 ` ,
       ` 2 ^ 7 8 = ( 2 ^ 3 9 ) ^ 2 == 1 1 1 ^ 2 = 5 N - 1 9 4 ` ,
       ` 2 ^ 1 5 6 = ( 2 ^ 7 8 ) ^ 2 == 1 9 4 ^ 2 = 1 5 N + 9 1 ` ,
       ` 2 ^ 3 1 2 = ( 2 ^ 1 5 6 ) ^ 2 == 9 1 ^ 2 = 3 N + 7 7 2 ` ,
       ` 2 ^ 6 2 4 = ( 2 ^ 3 1 2 ) ^ 2 == 7 7 2 ^ 2 = 2 3 8 N + 2 7 0 ` ,
       ` 2 ^ 1 2 4 8 = ( 2 ^ 6 2 4 ) ^ 2 == 2 7 0 ^ 2 = 2 9 N + 3 1 3 ` ,
       ` 2 ^ 1 2 5 1 = 2 ^ 1 2 4 8 x. 8 == 3 1 3 x. 8 = N + 1 ` and finally
       ` 2 ^ ( N - 1 ) = ( 2 ^ 1 2 5 1 ) ^ 2 == 1 ^ 2 = 1 ` .  (Contributed by
       Mario Carneiro, 3-Mar-2014.)  (Revised by Mario Carneiro, 20-Apr-2015.)
